.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-electron
**/release*
apps/desktop
apps/web
web-release
apps/remote-365-mobile
apps/android-host
packages/native-*
docs
deploy
.env
.env.*
!.env*.example
*.log
